{"id": "9th-rev-q025", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "aagupeyar-muthalaagupeyar-pyq", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] \"மல்லிகை சூடினாள்\" - இத்தொடரில் அமைந்துள்ள ஆகுபெயர் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பொருளாகுபெயர் (முதலாகுபெயர் - மல்லிகை என்னும் முழுச்செடியின் பெயர் அதன் பூவிற்கு ஆகிவந்தது)", "B": "சினையாகுபெயர்", "C": "இடவாகுபெயர்", "D": "காலவாகுபெயர்"}, "explanation": "மல்லிகை என்னும் முழு முதற்பொருளின் பெயர் அதன் சினையாகிய பூவைக் குறிப்பதால் இது 'பொருளாகுபெயர்' அல்லது 'முதலாகுபெயர்' எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] In the phrase 'Malligai soodinaal', which metonymy (Aagupeyar) is exemplified?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Porulaagupeyar / Muthalaagupeyar (Whole plant name substituting for its flower limb - முதலாகுபெயர்)", "B": "Sinaiyaagupeyar", "C": "Idavaagupeyar", "D": "Kaalavaagupeyar"}, "explanation": "'Malligai' is a Porulaagupeyar transferring from the plant entity to the flower."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "20