{"id": "9th-rev-q038", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "punarchi-udambadumey-va-rule-pyq", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] \"ஏனை உயிர்வழி வவ்வும்\" - என்னும் புணர்ச்சி விதிப்படி 'வ்' என்னும் உடம்படுமெய் தோன்றும் சொல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பலா + இலை = பலாயிலை", "B": "பல + உயிர் = பலவுயிர்; குரு + அருள் = குருவருள்", "C": "கிளி + கூண்டு = கிளிக்கூண்டு", "D": "மர + வேர் = மரவேர்"}, "explanation": "இ, ஈ, ஐ அல்லாத பிற உயிரெழுத்துகள் (அ, ஆ, உ, ஊ, எ, ஒ, ஓ) நிலைமொழி ஈற்றில் நின்றால், வருமொழி உயிரோடு இணைய 'வ்' என்னும் உடம்படுமெய் தோன்றும் (பல [ல்+அ] + உயிர் = பல + வ் + உயிர் = பலவுயிர்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] Which word compound exhibits the insertion of glide 'v' (வ்) following the rule 'Aenai uyirvazhi vavvum'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Palaa + ilai = Palaayilai", "B": "Pala + uyir = Palavuyir; Guru + arul = Guruvarul", "C": "Kili + koondu = Kilikkoondu", "D": "Mara + vaer = Maravaer"}, "explanation": "Vowels other than i, ee, ai attract the 'v' glide, yielding Palavuyir."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Edu